  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Naturalists are proficient with light and medium armor, as well as shields. They are also proficient with nonmetallic tower shields. A naturalist wearing armor or using a shield with which he is not proficient incurs a percent chance equal to the item’s normal arcane spell failure chance for the contents of each of his preservation vessels to lose their potency and become useless overnight. This penalty applies if the naturalist uses such equipment for even a moment, and reapplies itself each day until he quits using that equipment.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/naturalist#toc2\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
